# What this app keeps beside the project.
#
# The run configurations belong to everybody working on it, so they are
# committed. Everything else is one machine's state — which files were
# open, where the caret was — and is not.
*
!.gitignore
!run/
!run/**

# tools.json is the exception this example is about: which image draws these
# diagrams is the project's business, not one machine's, so it is committed.
# The app writes this file without that line — add it, or the thing everybody
# is meant to share stays untracked.
!tools.json
